{"id":"vod_sn_37296","vodId":"37296","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"限制级杀手","name_cn":"限制级杀手","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a160d59661ddf700a95ce7e0a0c7a0d2.jpg"},"summary":"本作主人公“杀手先生”（樱井孝宏 配音）是一名职业杀手，只要接到委托就什么都杀，甚至是自己的父母或者是小学生的暑假作业。他有个弟子，是父母双亡的小学生，因为崇拜杀手先生而拜其为师。登场人物还有要向杀手先生报杀父之仇的17岁巨乳美少女、与杀手先生有多次近距离接触的警长、一条名为“五郎”的警犬。本动画每集篇幅为3分钟，充满了大量令人捧腹的冷笑话，可以说是以杀手先生为中心的冷笑话集锦。杀手先生虽然长相帅气，为人冷酷，实际上是个冷面笑匠，与美少女、警长等角色的接触中，产生各种超乎意料的搞笑桥段。　　本动画改编自TAMACHIKU创作的四格漫画。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:50:57","playable":true,"episodeCount":10,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C4WVUK6J261/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hMYahYJfug1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/S8T9uFSK201/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gvfgPUFLcK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uMSJCfejhn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/e3tnmmiY991/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gTPUrAZnfF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GqNe7TLXN01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ADJEnHCXVR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7Cjau2bzD31/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:12.622Z"}